---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: "foodpages.items"
  size: 1
  alias: food
permalink: "/food/{{ food.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ food.pageName }} Nutrition in Pregnancy"
  description: "{{ food.metaDescription }}"
  schemaType: WebPage
  bodyClass: page-food-detail
vizStyles: true
pageStyles:
  - /style/weekly-diet.css
  - /style/food.css?v=20261005-minimal
---

<article class="section food-static-page">
  <nav class="food-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/food/">Foods</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ food.displayName }}</span>
  </nav>

  <header class="food-detail-hero{% if food.image and food.image.src %} has-image{% endif %}">
    <div>
      <h1 class="food-detail-name{% if food.displayName | length > 40 %} is-long{% endif %}">{{ food.displayName }}</h1>
      {% if food.isAvoid %}
        <p class="food-hero-alert"><span class="food-safety-badge">Avoid in pregnancy</span> <a href="#food-safety">See why</a></p>
      {% elif food.isHumanMilk %}
        <p class="food-hero-alert">Historical data record only — not a pregnancy food recommendation.</p>
      {% elif food.isRawPulse or food.isRawFlour %}
        <p class="food-hero-alert">Uncooked ingredient — values are before cooking.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if food.image and food.image.src %}
      <figure class="food-detail-image">
        <img src="{{ food.image.src }}" alt="{{ food.image.alt or food.displayName }}"{% if food.image.width %} width="{{ food.image.width }}"{% endif %}{% if food.image.height %} height="{{ food.image.height }}"{% endif %} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
      </figure>
    {% endif %}
  </header>

  <section class="content-card food-chart-card" aria-labelledby="food-chart-title">
    <div class="food-chart-head">
      <p class="content-eyebrow">Per 100 g · about 3.5 oz</p>
      <h2 class="content-title" id="food-chart-title">Pregnancy nutrients in 100 g</h2>
      <p class="viz-summary">{{ food.summary }}</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="food-chart" aria-label="Share of daily pregnancy reference amount per nutrient">
      {% for row in food.chartRows %}
        <li class="food-chart-row">
          <span class="food-chart-name">{{ row.name }}</span>
          {% set amount = row.value | formatNumber %}<span class="food-chart-amount">{{ amount }}{% if amount != "—" %} {{ row.unit }}{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="viz-bar{% if row.percent >= 100 %} is-full{% endif %}" style="--pct: {{ row.barPercent }}%;" role="img" aria-label="{{ row.name }}: {% if row.displayPercent == null %}not available{% else %}{{ row.displayPercent }}% of the daily pregnancy reference{% endif %}"><span class="viz-bar-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
          <span class="viz-value" aria-hidden="true">{% if row.displayPercent == null %}—{% else %}{% if row.percent >= 100 %}<span class="viz-check">✓</span>{% endif %}{{ row.displayPercent }}%{% endif %}</span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <details class="viz-more food-table-details">
      <summary id="food-table-title">Show full nutrient table</summary>
      <div class="table-shell">
        <table class="data-table">
          <caption class="sr-only">Nutrients per 100 grams</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Nutrient</th><th scope="col" class="is-num">In 100 g</th><th scope="col" class="is-num">Daily reference</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for row in food.nutrientRows %}
              <tr><th scope="row">{{ row.name }}</th><td class="is-num">{{ row.value | formatNumber }} {{ row.unit }}</td><td class="is-num">{{ row.target }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  {% if food.warning or food.isRawPulse or food.isRawFlour %}
    <aside class="content-card food-safety-note{% if food.isAvoid %} is-avoid{% endif %}" id="food-safety" aria-labelledby="food-safety-title">
      <div class="food-safety-heading">
        <h2 class="food-explainer-title" id="food-safety-title">Food safety</h2>
        {% if food.warning %}<span class="food-safety-badge">{{ food.warning }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if food.isRawPulse %}
        <p class="content-summary">Cook dried pulses fully before eating; cooking also changes weight and nutrients per 100 g. <a href="https://www.efsa.europa.eu/en/news/lectins-food-undercooked-beans-pose-health-risk-says-efsa">EFSA on undercooked beans</a>{% if food.id == "16069" %} · <a href="/food/16070-lentils-mature-seeds-boiled/">Boiled lentils</a>{% endif %}</p>
      {% elif food.isRawFlour %}
        <p class="content-summary">Don't eat raw dough or batter; cook flour foods as directed. <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/no-raw-dough.html">CDC on raw flour</a></p>
      {% else %}
        <p class="content-summary">{{ food.warningText }}
          {% if food.id == "05028" or food.id == "13327" %}<a href="https://www.nhs.uk/pregnancy/keeping-well/foods-to-avoid/">NHS source</a>
          {% elif food.group == "Finfish and Shellfish Products" %}<a href="https://www.fda.gov/food/consumers/advice-about-eating-fish">FDA/EPA fish chart</a>
          {% else %}<a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/pregnant-women.html">CDC source</a>{% endif %}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="food-explainer" aria-labelledby="food-explainer-title">
    <h2 class="food-explainer-title" id="food-explainer-title">How to read this</h2>
    <p>During pregnancy you need more of certain nutrients each day, like folate, iron and choline. Each bar shows how much of that daily amount 100 g of {{ food.displayName }} provides. 100% means 100 g alone covers the whole day; smaller numbers show its share. A ✓ marks 100% or more.</p>
  </section>

  {% if not food.isHumanMilk %}
    <section class="food-next" aria-labelledby="food-next-title">
      <h2 class="food-explainer-title" id="food-next-title">Keep exploring</h2>
      <ul class="viz-pill-links">
        {% for link in food.toolLinks %}
          <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for link in food.readingLinks %}
          <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    {% if food.relatedFoods.length %}
      <section class="food-next" aria-labelledby="related-foods-title">
        <h2 class="food-explainer-title" id="related-foods-title">Similar foods</h2>
        <ul class="viz-link-list">
          {% for related in food.relatedFoods %}
            <li><a href="{{ related.url }}">{{ related.name }}</a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  <footer class="food-source-note viz-note">
    {% if food.displayName != food.pageName %}<p>USDA record: {{ food.pageName }} · {{ food.group }}</p>{% else %}<p>Food group: {{ food.group }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p>Values come from a historical USDA-based dataset; DHA and protein use illustrative benchmarks. Nutrient data can't show whether a food is safe — see <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/pregnant-women.html">CDC pregnancy food safety</a>. <a href="/about/#food-data-sources">Sources and limits</a>. Not medical advice. Image is illustrative.</p>
  </footer>
</article>
